{"id":"112301","t":{"th":"ใครว่าข้าไม่เหมาะเป็นจอมมาร","ro":"Maou Gakuin no Futekigousha: Shijou Saikyou no Maou no Shiso, Tensei shite Shison-tachi no Gakkou e Kayou","en":"The Misfit of Demon King Academy: History’s Strongest Demon King Reincarnates and Goes to School with His Descendants","na":"魔王学院の不適合者 ～史上最強の魔王の始祖、転生して子孫たちの学校へ通う～"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx112301-f88Fs2es4pSr.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx112301-f88Fs2es4pSr.jpg","color":"#865de4","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/112301-e50SRjhGDGUu.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":13,"dur":24,"season":"SUMMER","year":2020,"start":"2020-07-04","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Comedy","Fantasy"],"score":72,"pop":272377,"studio":"SILVER LINK.","desc":"Anos, the Demon King of Tyranny, has defeated humans, spirits, and gods alike. But even demon kings get tired of all the fighting sometimes! Hoping for a more peaceful life, Anos decides to reincarnate himself. When he wakes two thousand years later, though, he finds the world has become too peaceful--his descendants have grown weak and magic is in serious decline. Intending to reclaim his rightful place, he enrolls in Demon King Academy, where he finds that his magical power is off the charts. Literally. And because they can't measure his power, the faculty and other students regard Anos as a misfit. With the support of Misha, the one student he manages to befriend, the misfit (Demon King) begins his climb up the demon ranks!","descTh":"Anos ราชาปีศาจแห่ง Tyranny ได้เอาชนะมนุษย์ วิญญาณ และเทพเจ้า แต่แม้แต่ราชาปีศาจก็ยังเบื่อหน่ายกับการต่อสู้ในบางครั้ง! ด้วยความหวังที่จะมีชีวิตที่สงบสุขมากขึ้น อาโนสจึงตัดสินใจกลับชาติมาเกิดใหม่อีกครั้ง เมื่อเขาตื่นขึ้นมาในอีกสองพันปีต่อมา เขาก็พบว่าโลกสงบสุขเกินไป ลูกหลานของเขาเริ่มอ่อนแอลงและเวทมนตร์ก็ถดถอยลงอย่างรุนแรง ด้วยความตั้งใจที่จะทวงคืนตำแหน่งอันชอบธรรมของเขา เขาจึงสมัครเข้าเรียนใน Demon King Academy ซึ่งเขาพบว่าพลังเวทย์มนตร์ของเขาไม่อยู่ในแผน อย่างแท้จริง. และเนื่องจากพวกเขาไม่สามารถวัดพลังของเขาได้ คณาจารย์และนักศึกษาคนอื่นๆ จึงถือว่าอาโนสเป็นคนไม่เหมาะ ด้วยการสนับสนุนของ Misha นักเรียนคนเดียวที่เขาจัดการให้ผูกมิตรได้ ชายที่ไม่เหมาะ (ราชาปีศาจ) จึงเริ่มไต่อันดับขึ้นไปบนอันดับปีศาจ!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"9qJyDlZst8c","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/112301","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/40496","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"iqiyi","r":"TH","u":"https://www.iq.com/album/%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3-%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%8C%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A2-2022-1nc920c0db9?lang=th_th","lang":"dub","eps":[["11","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3-%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%8C%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A2-ep-11-rlpgo2t6sw?lang=th_th",1676566800,"d","q:5/20230217/2d/8c/v_171300618_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1430,"a":"vip"}],["12","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3-%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%8C%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A2-ep-12-27egxtwhon0?lang=th_th",1676566800,"d","q:2/20230217/17/7e/v_171300639_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1430,"a":"vip"}],["13","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B